{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The teru-teru bozu \u201cTerunyan\u201d loves The Sun.<br>Every day, she happily wanders around enjoying her favorite hobby: collecting elementals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Terunyan to Amanoiwato</i> is a rhythm game where Terunyan moves straight ahead while gathering elementals.<br>Time your actions to the beat and collect them more efficiently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When elementals enter the judgment area, it\u2019s your chance to collect them!<br>But be careful\u2014if you fail, Terunyan\u2019s motivation will drop, and the scenery will become covered in fog.<br>If her motivation reaches zero, Terunyan returns home, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry.<br>As Terunyan collects elementals, she builds up energy.<br>Use that energy to activate skills and blow away the fog created by mistakes!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2846000?t=1759154296","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759154296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759154296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759154296","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3525410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The teru-teru bozu \u201cTerunyan\u201d loves The Sun.<br>Every day, she happily wanders around enjoying her favorite hobby: collecting elementals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Terunyan to Amanoiwato</i> is a rhythm game where Terunyan moves straight ahead while gathering elementals.<br>Time your actions to the beat and collect them more efficiently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When elementals enter the judgment area, it\u2019s your chance to collect them!<br>But be careful\u2014if you fail, Terunyan\u2019s motivation will drop, and the scenery will become covered in fog.<br>If her motivation reaches zero, Terunyan returns home, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry.<br>As Terunyan collects elementals, she builds up energy.<br>Use that energy to activate skills and blow away the fog created by mistakes!</p>","developers":["Terunyan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846000/header.jpg?t=1759154296","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2846000/236358113/a8381068bc5f6e886fec9ddd15c5ac6a0110f60f/1759153251/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759154294","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2846000/236358113/a8381068bc5f6e886fec9ddd15c5ac6a0110f60f/1759153251/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759154294","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2846000/236358113/a8381068bc5f6e886fec9ddd15c5ac6a0110f60f/1759153251/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759154294","id":257208593,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208593/movie480.mp4?t=1759154294","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208593/movie_max.mp4?t=1759154294"},"name":"Ver 1.10","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com